{"id":"2352967b8ac4bcf4","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-discrete-semimeasure.md","title":"Effective Discrete Semimeasures","display":"df-discrete-semimeasure — Effective Discrete Semimeasures","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure","aliases":["43-df-discrete-semimeasure"],"display":"df-discrete-semimeasure — Effective Discrete Semimeasures","depends_on":["[[43-df-string]]","[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]"],"source_book":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","source_version":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages","source_location":"Definition 6.9.1 and universal enumerable semimeasure discussion","source_printed_pages":"106","source_pdf_pages":"126","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-discrete-semimeasure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-discrete-semimeasure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-discrete-semimeasure — Effective Discrete Semimeasures"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1cb4649e6af56ba4\" href=\"?note=1cb4649e6af56ba4\" title=\"43-df-string\">43-df-string</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book","html":"Rodney G. Downey and Denis R. Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"source_version","html":"Draft, 2007-07-28; supplied PDF, 629 pages"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 6.9.1 and universal enumerable semimeasure discussion"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"106"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"126"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\">\\(m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LSC}(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{LSC}(m)\\)</span> 是统一下半可计算性，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc3ac987908461b8\" href=\"?note=cc3ac987908461b8\" title=\"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function\">43-df-lower-semicomputable-function</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}\\)</span> 由本节 Assertion 的形式定义引入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*}m(\\sigma)\\le1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*}m(\\sigma)\\le1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里的样本点是有限串本身，故求和遍历全部串；与连续半测度的树不等式不同。统一下半可计算性不能用逐点左 c.e. 代替。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 2007-07-28 草稿，Definition 6.9.1 and universal enumerable semimeasure discussion；印刷页 106，PDF 页 126。本次逐项核对陈述；来源证明的已读范围见本次审阅账本，未作机器形式验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-string","status":"resolved","id":"1cb4649e6af56ba4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-string]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-lower-semicomputable-function","status":"resolved","id":"cc3ac987908461b8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)$；$\\mathrm{LSC}(m)$ 是统一下半可计算性，见 [[43-df-lower-semicomputable-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"m:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LSC}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\sum_{\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*}m(\\sigma)\\le1,","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{DiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\mathrm{LSC}(m),","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UniversalDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(m)\\land\\forall\\nu:\\Sigma^*\\to[0,\\infty)\\left(\\mathrm{EffectiveDiscreteSemimeasure}(\\nu)\\to\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\nu(\\sigma)\\le c\\,m(\\sigma)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2064,"backlinks":[{"id":"cfad5734457defe6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]] — Effective Discrete Semimeasures"},{"id":"4432074d06eed551","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$U$ 满足 $\\mathrm{UniversalPF}(U)$，$\\mathbf m_U$ 与相应谓词见 [[43-df-apriori]]、[[43-df-discrete-semimeasure]]。"}],"outgoing":["1cb4649e6af56ba4","cc3ac987908461b8"]}